Smokeloader malware is distributed via email messages with malicious JavaScript attachments (such as Заявка.js). The JavaScript executes PowerShell commands to download an executable payload crsse.exe (Smokeloader) from http://enterwords.ru/uadoc/crsse.exe. Once executed, Smokeloader injects into explorer.exe and downloads a cryptocurrency miner curl.exe from http://parodadoca.ru/panel/mr/curl.exe to mine Monero.

